{"id":"n15046-2-6","stage":4,"title":"가로채다 · 打断","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15046-2-6-1","ko":"내 말 좀 가로채지 마.","zh":"别打断我说话。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"말","meaning":"语言，话","explanation":"말：语言，话","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"3","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"가로채지","meaning":"打断","explanation":"가로채다：打断；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"가로채다","audio":"/audio/a24c38e003fcc9b265fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15046","senseId":"2","lemma":"가로채다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가로채지","audio":"/audio/42da0d806c3ad496c901.mp3"}},{"text":"마.","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"1","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마","audio":"/audio/0a8a81fee098641dbae5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"语言，话","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的声音和文字。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"a24c38e003fcc9b2","term":"가로채다","zh":"打断","audio":"/audio/a24c38e003fcc9b265fd.mp3","entryId":"15046","definition":"在别人说话途中插进去，使不能继续说话。","pronunciation":["가로채다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ebbe273a5b90aa0a6c35.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15046-2-6-2","ko":"그러니까 너도 빨리 네 얘기를 하란 말이야.","zh":"所以你也快点说说你自己的事啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러니까","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그러니까：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그러니까","audio":"/audio/f064d1058a27cd3851f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58609","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러니까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러니까","audio":"/audio/f064d1058a27cd3851f3.mp3"}},{"text":"너도","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너도","audio":"/audio/31b5ecd28525b86681fe.mp3"}},{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"얘기를","meaning":"谈话，说话","explanation":"얘기：谈话，说话；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"얘기","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74194","senseId":"1","lemma":"얘기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얘기를","audio":"/audio/d30eac53cdc9b914c064.mp3"}},{"text":"하란","meaning":"说（话、意见或故事）","explanation":"하다：说（话、意见或故事）；란：引用名词判断、名称或命令内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"28","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하란","audio":"/audio/31c67f3e66d25f1e329d.mp3"}},{"text":"말이야.","meaning":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","explanation":"말：表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"11","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이야","audio":"/audio/fd5a3f00cd7342725148.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f064d1058a27cd38","term":"그러니까","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/f064d1058a27cd3851f3.mp3","entryId":"58609","definition":"因为那个原因；或因为那样的缘故。","pronunciation":["그러니까"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc","term":"얘기","zh":"谈话，说话","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3","entryId":"74194","definition":"向某人诉说与某事实、状态、现象、经验、想法等有关的话。","pronunciation":["얘ː기"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"说（话、意见或故事）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"说（话、意见或故事）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27